<view class="wrap"><view wx:if="{{loading}}">正在读取订单…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:if="{{order}}"><view class="card"><view class="title">{{order.status}}</view><view class="sub">订单号 {{order.no}}</view><view>{{order.name}}</view><view>手围 {{order.wrist}}cm · {{order.beads.length}} 颗</view><view>珠串总长 {{order.length}}mm</view></view><view class="card"><view class="title">材料明细</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id">{{item.name}} {{item.mm}}mm × {{item.qty}} · ¥{{item.price}}/颗</view></view><view class="card"><view>材料 ¥{{order.goods}} · 运费 ¥{{order.ship}}</view><view class="title">订单总额 ¥{{order.total}}</view><view class="sub">总额含制作费用，以提交订单时的价格为准。</view></view><view class="card"><view>{{order.person}} · {{order.phone}}</view><view>{{order.addr}}</view></view><view class="sub" wx:if="{{!order.paymentAvailable}}">支付暂未开放，此订单尚不能在线付款。</view><button class="reorder" bindtap="reorder">按这款再买一条</button></block></view>